  "metadata": {
    "title": "Reasoning prompts trade more tokens for more accuracy",
    "description": "Direct answering, chain-of-thought, self-consistency, tree search, and graph search spend increasing tokens or search to improve answers. Program-aided language models translate a calculation to code and use an interpreter for exact arithmetic."
